graph TD
    Controller[controller/] --> Agent[agent/mcp/Nl2SqlMcpAgent]
    Agent --> Session[agent/session/]
    Agent --> Store[agent/memory/ConversationStore]
    Agent --> McpClient[agent/mcp/McpToolClient]
    Store -.implements.-> InMem[agent/memory/InMemoryConversationStore]
    InMem --> Compressor[agent/memory/MemoryCompressor]
    InMem --> Policy[agent/memory/CompressionPolicy]
    Compressor --> LlmClient[llm/LlmClient]
    McpClient -.implemented by.-> Stdio[agent/mcp/StdioMcpToolClient]
    Stdio -->|STDIO| Sub[mcp/server/McpServerFactory]
    Sub --> Tool[agent/tools/]
    Tool --> Sql[sql/SqlValidator + SqlExecutor]

    classDef rt fill:#ffd8b1
    classDef mem fill:#c8e6c9
    classDef mcp fill:#bbdefb
    classDef llm fill:#f8bbd0
    classDef tool fill:#d1c4e9
    classDef sql fill:#ffccbc

    class Agent,Session rt
    class Store,InMem,Compressor,Policy mem
    class McpClient,Stdio,Sub mcp
    class LlmClient llm
    class Tool tool
    class Sql sql
